cff-version: 1.2.0

message: >
  If you use AffectBridge or its structured LLM appraisal method
  in your work, please cite this repository.

title: "AffectBridge"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Chen"
    given-names: "KuangWei"

date-released: "2026-08-17"

license: Apache-2.0

repository-code: "https://github.com/KuangWei-hash/AffectBridge"

abstract: >
  AffectBridge is an experimental architecture for mapping narrative
  game events and character-specific viewpoints into structured ALMA
  appraisal input using small independent LLM workers, while retaining
  explicit ALMA emotion and mood dynamics for persistent NPC affect.

keywords:
  - affective computing
  - game AI
  - NPC
  - large language models
  - appraisal
  - ALMA
